=== base ===
# Supply Agreement

This Agreement is made between Glenholm Paper Mills Ltd (the "Seller") and Corriemuir Packaging Ltd (the "Buyer").

## 6. Payment
6.1 The Buyer shall pay each invoice within thirty (30) days of the invoice date.

## 8. Notices
8.1 The Seller shall give the Buyer not less than 60 days' notice of any price increase.
=== amendment ===
# Variation Agreement

This Variation is made on 15 July 2027 between Glenholm Paper Mills Ltd (the "Seller") and Corriemuir Packaging Ltd (the "Buyer").

1. In clause 6.1, "thirty (30) days" is replaced by "forty-five (45) days".
2. In clause 8.1, the reference to sixty days is replaced by ninety days.
